WEBVTT

00:12:29.752 --> 00:12:34.560
And because the greatest force
is the force of adaptation

00:12:34.584 --> 00:12:35.743
and inventiveness,

00:12:35.767 --> 00:12:37.806
if we can operate well together.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:40.251
So that's what I think
it's going to look like

00:12:40.275 --> 00:12:41.481
over this period of time.

00:12:41.505 --> 00:12:42.751
It will pass,

00:12:42.775 --> 00:12:44.473
the world will be very different,

00:12:44.497 --> 00:12:46.406
there will be a new world order,

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:47.809
but it will pass,

00:12:47.833 --> 00:12:49.147
and we'll be inventive,

00:12:49.171 --> 00:12:53.136
because what we're dealing with now
is just money and credit.

00:12:53.478 --> 00:12:55.771
Money and credit is just digital.

00:12:55.795 --> 00:12:57.402
I mean, there's no --

00:12:57.426 --> 00:13:00.788
There is real good services,
you know, those are real.